<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5248" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμητίσκος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμης,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Telecl.
			1.12
		</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
			Pherecr.
			130.7
		</span></i> codd. <i><span class="en">
			Ath.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμητος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ]</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάω</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reaping, harvesting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.223
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>harvest, harvest-time,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				384
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				575
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.8.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.4.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.418
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>crop, harvest gathered in,</i> or <i>field when reaped,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				194
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				1097
			</span></i>: with another Subst., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληΐοιο ἀμήτοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					1.527
				</span></i>
			: metaph., of a beard, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.368
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>). (Gramm. distinguish <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμητος</span> (<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>) from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμητός</span> (<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>), the latter being regarded as Adj. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτος</span>), cf. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.220
			</span></i>, but <i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
			</span></i> reverses the distinction.) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμητρίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμητήρ,</span> dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.122
			</span></i>.</div>
